OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChilly for most today, but
OL,6,Fgenerally dry with sunshine favouring
OL,7,Fthe southeast. Cloud turns thicker in
OL,8,Fthe northwest through the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith wet and windy weather moving into
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland
OL,11,Fbefore evening with a risk of gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTonight, wet weather and
OL,14,Fstrong winds will persist in the north
OL,15,Fand west, turning heavier at times and
OL,16,Fwintry over northern hills. Remaining
OL,17,Fdry across central and eastern England.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
