OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy and rather damp across
OL,6,Fcentral and southern parts, feeling
OL,7,Fparticularily chilly. Drier across
OL,8,FScotland and Northern Ireland with
OL,9,Flong sunny spells, scattered showers
OL,10,Fand easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
